 title="Use dark theme"><span aria-hidden="true">☾</span></button><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" data-menu-toggle aria-controls="primary-navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></nav></header><main id="conteudo"><section class="page-hero marketing-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Features</p><h1>Essential controls in one workflow.</h1><p class="hero-lead">A management system for small businesses to organize customers, operations, inventory, purchasing, finance and documents without losing context.</p></div><div class="page-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/illustration-modules.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></div></section><section class="section features-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="feature-grid page-feature-grid"><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">01</span><h2>A dashboard for the moment</h2><p>Customers, pending work, balances and the pulse of the operation without endless menus.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">02</span><h2>Customers with context</h2><p>Contacts, company details, notes, tags, search and filters close to the history.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">03</span><h2>From quote to delivery</h2><p>Quotes, approval, work-order conversion and follow-up without re-entering the same information.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">04</span><h2>Inventory that guides</h2><p>Inbound and outbound records, physical stock, reservations, availability, minimum stock and replenishment.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">05</span><h2>Connected purchasing</h2><p>Suppliers, purchase orders, receiving, average cost and financial commitment in the same flow.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">06</span><h2>Straightforward finance</h2><p>Income, expenses, categories, periods, balances, cash flow, PDF, XLSX and local backup.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">07</span><h2>Documents become information</h2><p>Camera or import, OCR, text, multi-page files, PDF and sharing on the device.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">08</span><h2>Rumman Assistant</h2><p>Text, optional voice dictation, selected attachments, history, favorites, search and memory when requested by the user.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-code">09</span><h2>Protection when replacing a device</h2><p>With Android backup enabled, the operational database may be restored through the same Google Account. Android controls the process; scanned images and attachments are excluded.</p></article></div><div class="capability-strip"><span>Email or Google login</span><span>Biometric protection</span><span>Light and dark themes</span><span>Local data by design</span></div></div></section><section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap final-cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Rumman · Guided Intelligent ERP</p><h2>Clearer management for work with less friction.</h2><p>Organize customers, cash flow, documents and everyday decisions in a guided Android experience.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/en/features">Discover features</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><div class="footer-brand-block"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="/en/"><span class="brand-icon"><img src="/assets/rumman-brand-mark-original.png" width="680" height="680" alt=""></span><span class="brand-name">Rumman</span></a><p>Guided intelligent Android ERP for small businesses.</p><a class="footer-contact" href="mailto:e-mail@rumman.app.br">Contact Rumman: e-mail@rumman.app.br</a><nav class="language-switcher footer-language" aria-label="Language"><span class="visually-hidden">Language</span><a href="/recursos" lang="pt-BR">PT</a><a href="/en/features" lang="e